  "verseCount": 31,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "4",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "GAL 4"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "4",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 4:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hebu lolani mfwano huno. Wakati mrisi achere mwanache, kana tafwauti na mtumwa, hata dzagbwe mali yosi ni yakpwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.4.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.4.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 4:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ni lazima aogophe arezie na aimirizi a malize hadi wakati uriopangbwa ni ise. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.4.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.4.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 4:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Phahi hata swiswi huriphokala tahudzangbwekombolwa ni Jesu hwakala dza vivyo. Hwakala atumwa huchitawalwa ni mila na dini za chidunia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.4.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.4.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 4:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ela wakati wa sawa uriphofika, Mlungu wamhuma Mwanawe mwenye. Wavyalwa ni mchetu na achiishi kulunga Shariya za Musa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.4.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.4.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 4:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ROM.8.15+ROM.8.16+ROM.8.17"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Arumi 8:15–17",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ili akombole atu okala akahendwa atumwa ni Shariya hizo, ndipho nao akale ana a Mlungu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.4.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.4.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 4:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sambi kpwa sababu hu ana a Mlungu, Mlungu wareha Roho wa Mwanawe mwehu mioyoni, naye Roho nkumuiha Mlungu “Baba!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.4.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.4.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 4:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kpwa hivyo simwi atumwa tsona, ela mu ana a Mlungu, na kpwa vira mu anae, chila chitu aricho nacho ni chenu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.4.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.4.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 4:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.4.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.4.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 4:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kare mriphokala tamummanya Mlungu, mwakala atumwa mchihumikira viumbe ambavyo kala si Mlungu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.4.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.4.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 4:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ela sambi mnamanya Mlungu, au kpwa kpweli naamba: Mlungu anakumanyani. Phahi msiuyire tsona mila na dini za chidunia, ambazo tazina nguvu wala mana. Dze, mnalonda mhendwe atumwa a mambo higo tsona? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.4.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.4.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 4:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bado mcherelunga sharee za siku malumu, miezi, majira na miaka ili kumuhamira Mlungu! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.4.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.4.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 4:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nakuonerani mbazi sana. Mana naona kama avi náhenda kazi ya bure kpwenu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.4.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.4.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 4:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Enehu, nakuvoyani mkale dza mimi kpwa sababu sihendwa mtumwa tsona ni Shariya. Mana hata mimi nákala dza vivyo murivyo pho mwandzo: kalani atu asio na lazima ya kulunga shariya za Chiyahudi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.4.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.4.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 4:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tamyanikosera rorosi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.4.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.4.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 4:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mnamanya kala ukongo wangu ndio urionihenda nedze nikutangazireni habari nono kuhusu Jesu kano ya kpwandza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.4.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.4.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 4:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kala munaweza kunikahala au kunibera kpwa sababu ya ukongo wangu, ela tamyahenda hivyo. Ela mwanikaribisha avi ni malaika wa Mlungu, ama dza Masihi Jesu mwenye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.4.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.4.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 4:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dze, raha yenu muriokala nayo wakati hinyo yaphiyaphi? Nakuambirani kpweli, kala inawezekana mngesokola matso genu mkanipha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.4.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.4.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 4:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dze, sambi ni mviha wenu kpwa kukuambirani ukpweli?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.4.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.4.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 4:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.4.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.4.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 4:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hinyo atu alondao mlunge shariya za Chiyahudi, anaaza kukuhalani zewe, ili mkale kundi rao. Ela nia yao sio nono. Analonda akutenganisheni na mimi ili muashuulikire aho zaidi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.4.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.4.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 4:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ni vinono kuaza kuhenda mambo ambago niaye ni nono. Ni lazima muhende hivyo wakati wosi, hata ichikala sipho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.4.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.4.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 4:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Enehu, asena angu, hino ni kano ya phiri kusikira utsungu kpwa sababu yenu, dza viratu mchetu wa mimba avyalaye. Na hinyo utsungu undaenderera vivyo hadi maisha genu ndiphoonyesa tabiya za Jesu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.4.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.4.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 4:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naaza kala ni phamwenga namwi, na nikuambireni pore-pore. Ela kpwa sababu sipho, kpweli munanitiya wasiwasi sana.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.4.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.4.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 4:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.4.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.4.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 4:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hebu niambirani mwimwi mmendzao kulunga Shariya za Musa: Kpwani, tammanya Maandiko ga Musa gaambavyo? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.4.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.4.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 4:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GEN.16.15"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mwandzo 16:15",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GEN.21.2"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mwandzo 21:2",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maandiko ganaamba kukala Burahimu wavyala anae airi alume. Mmwenga wamvyala na mchetu mtumwa na wanjina achimvyala na mchetu ambaye kala siye mtumwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.4.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.4.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 4:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yuya mwanawe yemvyala na mchetu mtumwa, wavyalwa na mpango wa chibinadamu bahi. Ela yuya mwana yemvyala na mchetu ambaye kala siye mtumwa, wamvyala kpwa sababu Mlungu watimiza chilaganeche kpwa Burahimu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.4.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.4.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 4:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.4.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.4.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 4:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mambo higa ganaweza kuhendwa dza ndarira, mana hara achetu airi anafwananishwa na vilagane viiri. Hagari ambaye kala ni mtumwa ni mfwano wa chilagane chohendwa dzulu ya Mwango Sinai; chilagane hichi chahenda atu akale atumwa piya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.4.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.4.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 4:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atu a Jerusalemu ya sambi ni atumwa kpwa sababu ya kulunga shariya za Chiyahudi. Aho ni atumwa dza Hagari ambaye anafwananishwa na chilagane chohendwa Mwango Sinai hiko Warabuni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.4.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.4.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 4:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ela Sara, ambaye siye mtumwa, wafwananishwa na Jerusalemu yanjina ya mlunguni. Naye ni dza mayo wehu. Naswi hu arisi a iyo Jerusalemu ya mlunguni, kusiko atumwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.4.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.4.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 4:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.54.1"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Isaya 54:1",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana Maandiko ganaamba,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.4.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.4.27"
            ]
